    "post_text": [
      "Roundabouts Consignments has been a part of Columbia's resale scene since 2003. We provide a quick, convenient way to sell your gently-used furniture, home decor, and clothing in a department store-like atmosphere. We offer our shoppers a huge selection of items to choose from; all at very affordable prices.",
      "✨Welcome to our New Arrivals Corner! 🏡\nStep into a space that feels just like home. From beautiful furniture to unique decor, every piece has been carefully selected to help you create a home you'll love.\nOur newest arrivals don't stay on the floor for long, and many are one-of-a-kind. If you see something you love, don't wait—it could be gone tomorrow!\n📍Visit us in Columbia, SC and shop the latest arrivals before they're gone.\n🛍️ New treasures arrive every day, so there's always something new to discover\n\n📍70 Polo Road,\nColumbia, SC 29223\n⏰Tuesday-Saturday \n10 AM-6 PM\n🛍️Browse our online collection through the link inour\nprofile.\n\n#roundaboutsconsignments #columbiasc #shopcolumbiasc #columbiafurniture #columbiashopping #southcarolinashopping #newarrivals #FurnitureFinds #homedecor #HomeInspiration #LivingRoomGoals #interiorstyle #consignmentfinds #shoplocal #SupportLocal #oneofakindfinds #homesweethome #FurnitureLovers #treasurehunt #VisitColumbiaSC"
